QT_TRANSLATE_NOOP("ScriptApi", "What an action returns: a Promise that resolves when the action is done, with until(), which then checks the condition once per frame and resolves with its first truthy value, doing the action again, as often as retry allows, when it does not come true in time. The condition may return a Promise, as vision.find() does. until() rejects with a TimeoutError (GS-API-030) when the tries run out and with an AbortError when the task is cancelled; it throws GS-API-008 for a condition that is not a function, GS-API-011 for options that are not an object, GS-API-003 for a timeoutMs out of range and GS-API-017 for a retry out of range.");
QT_TRANSLATE_NOOP("ScriptApi", "A binding made with bind(); dispose() stops it and puts the property back to its value from before the binding. Bindings made inside a task stop when that task ends, those made at module top level last as long as the script.");
